Status: Accepted

Date: 2026-01-20

Owner:
Chief Architect

## Context

Engineering teams need AI grounded in enterprise documentation...

## Problem

LLMs hallucinate without enterprise context.

## Options Considered

1. Fine-tuning
2. RAG
3. Prompt-only

## Decision

Adopt Enterprise RAG using vector search.

## Rationale

- Lower cost
- Easier updates
- Better governance
- Explainability

## Consequences

Positive:
- Better AI accuracy
- Faster updates

Negative:
- Requires vector infrastructure

